	(text "U1172 P0 / P1 / P3: DATA / CLOCK / LATCH.\nU1172 P2: host orientation. P4: HUB_RUN.\nU1172 P5 / P6: input-protection fault / charging PG.\nGPIO16 reads HOST_BUDGET_FAULT_N.\nBits 0–4 select 9 V, bits 5–9 discharge targets.\nBit 10 enables the charging input; bits 11–12 select host budget; bit 13 enables host targets."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
